      "apiDescription": "## Models\n\nTwo-way bindings. Bind each one with the `v-model` syntax shown next to it — do not pass the prop and listen to its `update:` event separately.\n\n```\nexport type GSegmentedModels = {\n  /**\n   * @description binding value\n   * @default undefined\n   */\n  modelValue?: string | number | boolean | null; // v-model=\"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n```\nexport type GSegmentedProps = {\n  /** @default 'default' */\n  variant?: VariantSegmented;\n  /** @default 'md' */\n  rounded?: RoundedSegmented;\n  /** @default '' */\n  classItem?: string;\n  /**\n   * @description options of segmented\n   * @default []\n   */\n  options?: OptionSegmented[];\n  /** @description fit width of parent content */\n  block?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description size of component\n   * @default 'md'\n   */\n  size?: SizeSegmented;\n  /** @description whether segmented is disabled */\n  disabled?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description whether to trigger form validation\n   * @default true\n   */\n  validateEvent?: boolean;\n  /** @default '' */\n  messageError?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  helpText?: string;\n  /** @description native input id */\n  id?: string;\n  /** @description native `name` attribute */\n  name?: string;\n  ariaLabel?: string;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GSegmentedEvents = {\n  \"update:modelValue\": [val: any];\n  change: [val: any];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type GSegmentedSlots = {\n  default: { item: OptionSegmented; isActive: boolean; };\n  help: { error: string | undefined; isError: boolean; };\n}\n```",
      "renderer": "vue3"
    }
  }
